Here is the semantic interpretation of the scene based on the provided ontology:

### Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
```turtle
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "Cyclist Crossing Urban Road" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :actor1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1, :risk2 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 .

:actor1 a :Cyclist ;
    :description "Cyclist crossing road without yielding right-of-way" .

:weather1 a :DayCondition ;
    :description "Clear daytime conditions" .

:risk1 a :CollisionRisk ;
    :description "Potential collision with cyclist crossing against traffic flow" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:risk2 a :LaneIntrusionRisk ;
    :description "Cyclist intruding into vehicle lane from unexpected direction" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev2 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

:sev2 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.80"^^xsd:float .
```

